From 3a3067d27763fdbdb27e1c6ee1a28df725d45c75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alvaro Figueroa <alvarof@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:38:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] nordic: add muzi works Base Duo

nRF52840 with a Semtech LR1121 (nRFLR1121 module) on the internal SPI
bus, W25Q QSPI flash, a Qwiic/STEMMA QT connector and a display header
as two I2C buses, and a castellated UART.

Enables CIRCUITPY_ENABLE_MPY_NATIVE: the LR1121 driver and the
meshtastic codec ship as native .mpy files and the loader rejects them
without it.

USB PID 0xFEDE. The shipped UF2 bootloader keeps its own 0x0081, so a
host can tell the two modes apart.

Carried by cpy-meshtastic in temp-board-patches/ until the board is in
the tree it builds against.
---
 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/board.c     |   9 ++
 .../boards/muzi_base_duo/mpconfigboard.h      |  53 +++++++
 .../boards/muzi_base_duo/mpconfigboard.mk     |  17 +++
 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/pins.c      | 134 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 213 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/board.c
 create mode 100644 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/mpconfigboard.h
 create mode 100644 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/mpconfigboard.mk
 create mode 100644 ports/nordic/boards/muzi_base_duo/pins.c

